# MUST BE INCONSISTENT: a process has exactly one system limit (VDI 3682 Part 2, Fig. 2).
@prefix vdi3682: <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#> .
@prefix ex: <https://w3id.org/aias/example/neg#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/example/neg03> a owl:Ontology ; owl:imports <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682/2.0.0> .
ex:P a vdi3682:Process ; vdi3682:consistsOf ex:SL1 , ex:SL2 .
ex:SL1 a vdi3682:SystemLimit .
ex:SL2 a vdi3682:SystemLimit .
ex:SL1 owl:differentFrom ex:SL2 .
